{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26954","headline":"和令狐六员外直夜即事寄上相公 · 姚合","name":"和令狐六员外直夜即事寄上相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜台同处轩窗接，粉署先登语笑疎。\n皓月满帘听玉漏，紫泥盈手发天书。\n吟诗清美招闲客，对酒逍遥卧直庐。\n荣贵人间难有比，相公离此十年余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}